<title>UK: MFI up as SBC Warburg raises to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>MFI up as SBC Warburg raises to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Britain's MFI Furniture Plc rose sharply for a second day on Wednesday as analysts at SBC raised the stock to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;add,&quot; dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 8-1/2p at 200-1/2 by 1445 GMT, after rising 6p on Tuesday. The stock dropped to a near six-month low of 182p on February 24.</p>
<p>Analysts at Warburg were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
